udeaVerifyDeterminism is a cheap first filter, not the determinism gate. It sees direct references only: nondeterminism laundered through Fleks internals, through an interface call whose receiver happens to be a HashMap, or through float differences between two JVMs is invisible to it. The gate is WorldHasher snapshot equivalence and the cross-OS replay-equality CI job. See determinism-audit.md for the full list of what this cannot see.


